        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/495429?u=2f3b9dd03c6c4a961d44a632fe1976c73fa19e1f&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Refines the <code class=\"notranslate\">pr-review-companion</code> workflow:</p>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Identifies the PR number via the GitHub API, instead of using the <code class=\"notranslate\">NR</code> file in the build artifact.</li>\n<li>Reports the review deployment status on fork PRs as well, using the <code class=\"notranslate\">head_sha</code> from the <code class=\"notranslate\">workflow_run</code> payload.</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Improve the security of the workflow.</li>\n<li>Make review deployment status visible on fork PRs.</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Same approach as in Fred:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3837371744\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/fred/issues/1235\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/fred/pull/1235/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/fred/pull/1235\">mdn/fred#1235</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3857861442\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/fred/issues/1258\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/fred/pull/1258/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/fred/pull/1258\">mdn/fred#1258</a></li>\n</ul>",
