        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1490400?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">The Mouse and Wheel Events interfaces are moving from the UI Events specification to the Pointer Events specification. This PR attempts to make the move as smoothly as possible.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">Avoid breaking the documentation due to spec changes.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">See also:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3805715905\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/w3c/pointerevents/issues/564\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/w3c/pointerevents/pull/564/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/w3c/pointerevents/pull/564\">w3c/pointerevents#564</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3810188653\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/w3c/uievents/issues/411\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/w3c/uievents/pull/411/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/w3c/uievents/pull/411\">w3c/uievents#411</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3896043713\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/28974\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28974/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28974\">mdn/browser-compat-data#28974</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3814461733\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/web-platform-dx/web-features/issues/3690\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/web-platform-dx/web-features/pull/3690/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/web-platform-dx/web-features/pull/3690\">web-platform-dx/web-features#3690</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Wait for those 2 pull requests to get merged before merging this one.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n\n\n\n",
