        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7352080?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Address is the dev-doc-needed requirements of <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2012727\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bug 2012727</a> \"action.isEnabled() throws instead of returning the global enabled state\" by:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Marking <code class=\"notranslate\">details</code> as optional in:\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Mozilla/Add-ons/WebExtensions/API/action/isEnabled\" rel=\"nofollow\">action.isEnabled</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Mozilla/Add-ons/WebExtensions/API/browserAction/isEnabled\" rel=\"nofollow\">browserAction/isEnabled</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Add a note to the <code class=\"notranslate\">action.isEnabled</code> documentation that in Chrome, the parameter is not a details object but an (optional) tabId integer.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related BCD changes in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3892397630\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/28964\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28964/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28964\">mdn/browser-compat-data#28964</a>.</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42997",
            "title": "Bug-2012727 `isEnabled` updates for `action` and `browseAction`",
