        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44868357?u=eac4520e2d0d57e1c2e4b3aca7febc9143729754&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">Mention the payload limit of 64 KiB for <code class=\"notranslate\">sendBeacon()</code>.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><strong>Fetch specification reference</strong>: <a href=\"https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#http-network-or-cache-fetch\" rel=\"nofollow\">HTTP-network-or-cache fetch</a> defines the 64 KiB limit for keepalive requests</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2008613\" rel=\"nofollow\">Firefox bug 2008613</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #42932.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3860035675\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42932\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/42932/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42932\">#42932</a></p>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">Relates to <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"1899218243\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/20721\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/20721/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/20721\">mdn/browser-compat-data#20721</a>, <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3868568077\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42957\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/42957/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42957\">#42957</a></p>\n\n",
