        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23019147?u=4c0de81596ced64dc067dea5686f7ca2912db0cb&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR updates the tutorial at <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/IndexedDB_API/Checking_when_a_deadline_is_due\" rel=\"nofollow\">Checking when a deadline is due</a> to reflect the changes in the <code class=\"notranslate\">dom-examples/to-do-notifications</code> code to automatically populate years.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">To keep content and corresponding example code in sync</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n\n\n\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">Depends on: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3793642097\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/dom-examples/issues/372\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/dom-examples/pull/372/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/dom-examples/pull/372\">mdn/dom-examples#372</a><br>\n<g-emoji class=\"g-emoji\" alias=\"warning\">⚠️</g-emoji> This PR should be merged only after the dom-examples PR is merged</p>",
